# fail-early checks. One command per line: "<when>: <command>"
#   stop: runs when Claude finishes a turn that edited files. Put every completion check here.
#   edit: runs after every file edit. Only for checks under ~5 seconds. Optional.
# Commands run from the repository root (the worktree root inside a worktree).
# A line that does not start with "stop: " or "edit: " is ignored.
#
# stop: pnpm exec tsc --noEmit
# stop: pnpm test
